body:
Creates a production-ready e-commerce landing page with trust-optimized design, interactive features, and Shopify theme compatibility.

**Screenshot**: https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4786412d-e888-41cc-b208-b6968f496c81

## Implementation

### Core Website
- **index.html**: Semantic HTML5 structure with hero, products, categories, testimonials, newsletter
- **styles.css**: CSS custom properties, gradient palette (`#6366f1`, `#8b5cf6`, `#ec4899`), responsive breakpoints, animations
- **script.js**: Shopping cart state management, smooth scroll navigation, form handling, intersection observers

### Trust & Conversion Elements
- Security badges (SSL, secure payment, 30-day guarantee)
- Social proof (50K+ customers, 4.8★ rating)
- Customer testimonials with verified buyer status
- Free shipping threshold messaging

### Shopify Integration
- **layout/theme.liquid**: Main template with Liquid tags and Shopify object access
- **snippets/meta-tags.liquid**: Dynamic SEO/OG tags with structured data (Schema.org)
- **theme.json**: Theme configuration with color settings

### SEO & Performance
- Open Graph and Twitter Card meta tags
- JSON-LD structured data for products and organization
- HTTPS-enforced asset URLs
- Dynamic copyright year generation

### Documentation
- **README.md**: Feature overview and customization guide
- **SHOPIFY_INTEGRATION.md**: Product import, payment setup, app recommendations
- **DEPLOYMENT.md**: Multi-platform deployment (Shopify, Netlify, AWS, traditional hosting)

## Code Example

Interactive cart with real-time UI updates:

```javascript
addToCartButtons.forEach(button => {
    button.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
        cartCount++;
        cartCountElement.textContent = cartCount;
        showNotification('Product added to cart! 🛒');

        this.textContent = 'Added ✓';
        this.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%)';
    });
});
```

Responsive gradient design system:

```css
:root {
    --primary-color: #6366f1;
    --secondary-color: #8b5cf6;
    --accent-color: #ec4899;
}

.gradient-text {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color) 0%, var(--secondary-color) 50%, var(--accent-color) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
}
```

Security scan: 0 vulnerabilities. Code review feedback addressed (removed debug logs, enforced HTTPS, dynamic year).

